                "description": "The Helios Lever with Neos Rose has a fashionable, modern design. It is not only chic, it is also comfortable to the hand, which can sometimes be neglected in similar leversets. The Helios Lever with Modern Rectangular Neos Rosette is available in a wide array of modern finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
